<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>{{ title }} — Chinese Slang Translator</title>
  <meta name="description" content="{{ description }}" />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://www.gecktool.com{{ page.url }}" />

  <meta property="og:type" content="article" />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://www.gecktool.com{{ page.url }}" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="{{ title }} — Chinese Slang Translator" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="{{ description }}" />
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="Gecktool" />

  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="{{ title }} — Chinese Slang Translator" />
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="{{ description }}" />

  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Article",
    "headline": {{ title | json }},
    "description": {{ description | json }},
    "url": "https://www.gecktool.com{{ page.url }}",
    "datePublished": "{{ date | date: '%Y-%m-%d' }}",
    "publisher": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "Gecktool",
      "url": "https://www.gecktool.com"
    }
  }
  </script>

  {% if faqs %}
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "mainEntity": [
      {% for faq in faqs %}{
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": {{ faq.q | json }},
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": {{ faq.a | json }}
        }
      }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}{% endfor %}
    ]
  }
  </script>
  {% endif %}

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --blue: #1a56db;
      --blue-dark: #1246b3;
      --blue-light: #e8f0fe;
      --gray-50: #f8f9fa;
      --gray-100: #f1f3f5;
      --gray-200: #e9ecef;
      --gray-400: #868e96;
      --gray-600: #495057;
      --gray-800: #212529;
      --text: #1a1a2e;
      --text-muted: #6c757d;
      --border: #dee2e6;
      --radius: 12px;
    }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background: #fff;
      line-height: 1.7;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    /* ── Nav ── */
    nav {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      z-index: 100;
    }
    .nav-inner {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 24px;
      height: 60px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .logo {
      font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--blue);
      letter-spacing: -0.3px; text-decoration: none;
    }
    .logo span { color: var(--text); }
    .nav-brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
    .logo-gt { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; }
    .logo-gt:hover { color: var(--text); }
    .logo-gt span { color: var(--blue); }
    .nav-sep { color: var(--border); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 28px; list-style: none; }
    .nav-links a { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--gray-600); text-decoration: none; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--text); }
    .nav-cta {
      background: var(--blue); color: #fff !important;
      padding: 8px 18px; border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 14px !important; font-weight: 600 !important;
    }
    .nav-cta:hover { background: var(--blue-dark) !important; }

    /* ── Article ── */
    .article-hero {
      background: var(--gray-50);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 56px 24px 48px;
    }
    .article-hero .container { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .breadcrumb {
      font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .breadcrumb a { color: var(--blue); text-decoration: none; }
    .breadcrumb a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    .article-title {
      font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 42px);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .article-subtitle {
      font-size: 18px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-weight: 400;
    }
    .article-meta {
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--blue-light);
      color: var(--blue);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 3px 10px;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }

    .article-body {
      padding: 56px 24px 80px;
    }
    .article-body .container {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* Markdown content styles */
    .content h2 {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 48px 0 16px;
      letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    }
    .content h3 {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 32px 0 12px;
    }
    .content p { margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 16px; }
    .content ul, .content ol { margin: 0 0 20px 24px; }
    .content li { margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 16px; }
    .content strong { font-weight: 600; }
    .content em { font-style: italic; }
    .content blockquote {
      border-left: 3px solid var(--blue);
      padding: 12px 20px;
      background: var(--blue-light);
      border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
      margin: 24px 0;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .content code {
      font-family: monospace;
      background: var(--gray-100);
      padding: 2px 6px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .content hr {
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      margin: 40px 0;
    }

    /* Example card */
    .example-card {
      background: var(--gray-50);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 20px 24px;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .example-card .zh {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .example-card .en {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    /* ── CTA box ── */
    .cta-box {
      background: var(--blue-light);
      border: 1px solid #c7d9f8;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 32px;
      margin-top: 56px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .cta-box h3 {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .cta-box p {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: var(--gray-600);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--blue);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 12px 28px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: background 0.15s;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--blue-dark); }

    /* ── Footer ── */
    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 32px 24px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }
    footer a { color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; }
    footer a:hover { color: var(--text); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <div class="nav-brand">
      <a href="/" class="logo-gt">Geck<span>tool</span></a>
      <span class="nav-sep">/</span>
      <a href="/Chinese-Slang-Translator/" class="logo">Chinese <span>Slang Translator</span></a>
    </div>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="/Chinese-Slang-Translator/blog/">Glossary</a></li>
      <li><a href="/Chinese-Slang-Translator/#pricing">Pricing</a></li>
      <li><a href="/Chinese-Slang-Translator/support.html">Contact</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/chinese-slang-translator/pilgpdbdibimblbdjepgekcfjippmnai" class="nav-cta" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Add to Chrome</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</nav>

<div class="article-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="breadcrumb">
      <a href="/Chinese-Slang-Translator/">Chinese Slang Translator</a> / <a href="/Chinese-Slang-Translator/blog/">Glossary</a> / {{ chinese }}
    </div>
    <h1 class="article-title">{{ title }}</h1>
    <p class="article-subtitle">{{ subtitle }}</p>
    <div class="article-meta">
      {% if category %}<span class="tag">{{ category }}</span>{% endif %}
      {% if difficulty %}<span class="tag">{{ difficulty }}</span>{% endif %}
      {% if date %}<span>Published {{ date | date: "%B %d, %Y" }}</span>{% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="article-body">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="content">
      {{ content }}
    </div>

    <div class="cta-box">
      <h3>Encounter more terms like this?</h3>
      <p>Chinese Slang Translator explains slang, business jargon, and cultural subtext instantly — just select any text while you browse.</p>
      <a href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/chinese-slang-translator/pilgpdbdibimblbdjepgekcfjippmnai" class="btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Add to Chrome — Free</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<footer>
  <a href="/Chinese-Slang-Translator/">Chinese Slang Translator</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp;
  <a href="/Chinese-Slang-Translator/blog/">Glossary</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp;
  <a href="/Chinese-Slang-Translator/support.html">Contact</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp;
  <a href="/Chinese-Slang-Translator/legal.html">Privacy</a>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
